  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Finance and Facilitation of Agricultural Value Chains (INCLUSIF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to increase financial inclusion for smallholders and agrifood Small and Medium Enterprises in Mali. There are two expected outcomes: (i) diversified, permanent and inclusive financial services and products are developed to benefit a large number of smallholders, including women and young people, and SMEs; and (ii) POs and SMEs develop profitable and sustainable partnerships.</narrative>
  </description>
